{"id":"en_silly-daddy-when-are-you-gonna-find-mommy","title":"Silly Daddy, When Are You Gonna Find Mommy","titleEn":"Silly Daddy, When Are You Gonna Find Mommy","description":"Crystal Smith has spent six years raising her daughter Mia by herself, ever since a single night together left her pregnant and working as a delivery rider. When Mia's pollen allergy needs costly treatment, Crystal enters the child in a modeling competition run by CEO Eric Wilson, hoping the prize money will cover the medical bills. The plan takes a dangerous turn when a rival locks Mia inside a room thick with pollen. Eric arrives in time to rescue her, and a DNA test afterward confirms what no one expected: Mia is his child.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/silly-daddy-when-are-you-gonna-find-mommy/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/silly-daddy-when-are-you-gonna-find-mommy/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Identity Twist","Second Chance","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtld6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_silly-daddy-when-are-you-gonna-find-mommy_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtld6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_silly-daddy-when-are-you-gonna-find-mommy_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtld6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_silly-daddy-when-are-you-gonna-find-mommy_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtld6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_silly-daddy-when-are-you-gonna-find-mommy